      "type": "object",
      "description": "A mnemonic strength policy artifact pinned by MnemonicState.strength_policy (Profile §6.1, Spec §59.1). A half_life policy computes effective_strength = memory_strength × 2^(−max(0, t − last_metabolized_at) / half_life_ms), t being the instant the read is evaluated. The pin's artifact_ref is policy_id; an unknown policy or a digest mismatch leaves effective_strength null.",
